{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open windows to breath fresh air,  ignoring this normal aspect has serious consequences when a disturbing force messes with your mind. Learn witchcraft, investigate, solve puzzles and search for ingredients to create a potion against the malevolence. Survive and investigate the unknown and find your way to freedom, if there is one...<strong><br><br>STORY</strong><br>Remorses is a slowly building, heart-aching journey, with tension that builds gradually, focused on an immersive atmospheric experience. <br> <br>The year is 1991 in Rivervalley, Lakota Territory. It is infamous for its history and missing people recently. Not long ago, rumors of witchcraft began to spread. Rivervalley has long history of false legends before.  <br> <br>Play as Jake Lepistow, an investigator from Beaver Hills, Minnesota. Chasing legends and supernatural occurrences without ever having to face consequences. When a series of strange disappearances and hints of witchcraft reached him, he got his eyes on his next investigation. A made up story of an abandoned Westbrook\u2019s Inheritance Mansion somewhere in the Rivervalley forest. The townspeople avoid it, terrified of its  reputation and the rumors of a vengeful witch.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2292160?t=1763673143","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763673143","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/179af32ad34b9503a127572ec9bcbf513d22e030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763673143","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/179af32ad34b9503a127572ec9bcbf513d22e030/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763673143","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content that is not suitable for all ages. The game may trigger epileptic seizures due to intense scenes. Viewer discretion highly advised. "},"detailed_description":"<h1>About this game</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ATMOSPHERE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the rich story that takes place, utterly atmospheric environments, and meticulous sound design that will keep you on the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/extras/dfa52d0c2ea3309f6f26a4b0c0ecbecb.poster.avif?t=1763673143\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/extras/dfa52d0c2ea3309f6f26a4b0c0ecbecb.webm?t=1763673143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/extras/dfa52d0c2ea3309f6f26a4b0c0ecbecb.mp4?t=1763673143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WITCHCRAFT </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for ingredients and try to brew a potential poison against wickedness, while uncovering the terrifying witchcraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/extras/998386e0b0624092b2da5e7dd50cefbc.poster.avif?t=1763673143\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/extras/998386e0b0624092b2da5e7dd50cefbc.webm?t=1763673143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/extras/998386e0b0624092b2da5e7dd50cefbc.mp4?t=1763673143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INVESTIGATION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the infamous Westbrook Mansion and find the terrifying answers for the questions you were obsessed about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/extras/c76c3a41d80ceedee6674eb6a084db2e.poster.avif?t=1763673143\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/extras/c76c3a41d80ceedee6674eb6a084db2e.webm?t=1763673143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/extras/c76c3a41d80ceedee6674eb6a084db2e.mp4?t=1763673143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SURVIVAL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a variety of visual, auditory and logic puzzles to unravel the horrifying truth... While being cautious of the many forms the darkness takes. Maintain your stealth and sanity as you face the horrors that lurk within...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/extras/8a973abe33b5c44b02a9ce4c2f5d8f2d.poster.avif?t=1763673143\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/extras/8a973abe33b5c44b02a9ce4c2f5d8f2d.webm?t=1763673143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/extras/8a973abe33b5c44b02a9ce4c2f5d8f2d.mp4?t=1763673143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WINDOWS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use windows to get fresh air and clear your head, that's your only option for your subsistence, neglect it and see what happens. Think about your routes ahead to navigate the environments safely. Something is messing with your head...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/extras/4dfc0e8ba7d8c49a010d61f5baf38e85.poster.avif?t=1763673143\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/extras/4dfc0e8ba7d8c49a010d61f5baf38e85.webm?t=1763673143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/extras/4dfc0e8ba7d8c49a010d61f5baf38e85.mp4?t=1763673143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>  Join our community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord community to discuss about horror, be part of the development process, and share your feedback. The link is available in the right panel.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/extras/1ab78c2b29b9a2596bde8e5dd8252a29.avif?t=1763673143\" width=640 height=180 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open windows to breath fresh air,  ignoring this normal aspect has serious consequences when a disturbing force messes with your mind. Learn witchcraft, investigate, solve puzzles and search for ingredients to create a potion against the malevolence. Survive and investigate the unknown and find your way to freedom, if there is one...<strong><br><br>STORY</strong><br>Remorses is a slowly building, heart-aching journey, with tension that builds gradually, focused on an immersive atmospheric experience. <br> <br>The year is 1991 in Rivervalley, Lakota Territory. It is infamous for its history and missing people recently. Not long ago, rumors of witchcraft began to spread. Rivervalley has long history of false legends before.  <br> <br>Play as Jake Lepistow, an investigator from Beaver Hills, Minnesota. Chasing legends and supernatural occurrences without ever having to face consequences. When a series of strange disappearances and hints of witchcraft reached him, he got his eyes on his next investigation. A made up story of an abandoned Westbrook\u2019s Inheritance Mansion somewhere in the Rivervalley forest. The townspeople avoid it, terrified of its  reputation and the rumors of a vengeful witch.</p>","developers":["Twistedline Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292160/header.jpg?t=1763673143","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2292160/1150426046/59a406bb149cf9bcf7842ae0c0ad03772a3f8201/1750980467/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748633776","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2292160/1150426046/59a406bb149cf9bcf7842ae0c0ad03772a3f8201/1750980467/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748633776","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2292160/1150426046/59a406bb149cf9bcf7842ae0c0ad03772a3f8201/1750980467/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748633776","id":257148567,"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257148567/0817b505115686364213b12bc6d6c2350080a94c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748633776"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2292160/1681674474/135c8cefe84840b3418f00c0bb1f6be87b7b0046/1761857064/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761858524","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2292160/1681674474/135c8cefe84840b3418f00c0bb1f6be87b7b0046/1761857064/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761858524","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.